{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01XcsZyaSiatphCMSPVM4jaB","type":"tool_result","content":"     1→<template>\n     2→  <div>\n     3→    <h1>Event Test</h1>\n     4→    \n     5→    <div>\n     6→      <label for=\"message-input\">Message:</label>\n     7→      <input id=\"message-input\" v-model=\"messageInput\" type=\"text\" />\n     8→      <button @click=\"sendNotification\" id=\"send-notification-btn\">Send Notification</button>\n     9→    </div>\n    10→    \n    11→    <div>\n    12→      <label for=\"custom-data-input\">Custom Data:</label>\n    13→      <input id=\"custom-data-input\" v-model=\"customDataInput\" type=\"text\" />\n    14→      <button @click=\"sendCustomEvent\" id=\"send-custom-btn\">Send Custom Event</button>\n    15→    </div>\n    16→    \n    17→    <div id=\"received-events\">\n    18→      <h3>Received Events:</h3>\n    19→      <div id=\"notification-events\">\n    20→        <strong>Notifications:</strong>\n    21→        <ul>\n    22→          <li v-for=\"(event, index) in notificationEvents\" :key=\"index\" class=\"notification-event\">\n    23→            {{ event.message }} ({{ event.timestamp }})\n    24→          </li>\n    25→        </ul>\n    26→      </div>\n    27→      <div id=\"custom-events\">\n    28→        <strong>Custom Events:</strong>\n    29→        <ul>\n    30→          <li v-for=\"(event, index) in customEvents\" :key=\"index\" class=\"custom-event\">\n    31→            {{ event.data }} (count: {{ event.count }})\n    32→          </li>\n    33→        </ul>\n    34→      </div>\n    35→    </div>\n    36→    \n    37→    <div id=\"event-counters\">\n    38→      <div id=\"notification-count\">Notification Count: {{ notificationEvents.length }}</div>\n    39→      <div id=\"custom-count\">Custom Event Count: {{ customEvents.length }}</div>\n    40→    </div>\n    41→  </div>\n    42→</template>\n    43→\n    44→<script setup lang=\"ts\">\n    45→import { ref } from \"vue\"\n    46→import { useLiveVite, useLiveEvent } from \"live_vite\"\n    47→\n    48→interface Props {\n    49→  message: string\n    50→  event_count: number\n    51→}\n    52→\n    53→interface NotificationEvent {\n    54→  message: string\n    55→  timestamp: number\n    56→}\n    57→\n    58→interface CustomEvent {\n    59→  data: string\n    60→  count: number\n    61→}\n    62→\n    63→const props = defineProps<Props>()\n    64→const live = useLiveVite()\n    65→\n    66→const messageInput = ref(\"\")\n    67→const customDataInput = ref(\"\")\n    68→const notificationEvents = ref<NotificationEvent[]>([])\n    69→const customEvents = ref<CustomEvent[]>([])\n    70→\n    71→// Listen for notification events from the server\n    72→useLiveEvent<NotificationEvent>(\"notification\", (data) => {\n    73→  notificationEvents.value.push(data)\n    74→})\n    75→\n    76→// Listen for custom events from the server\n    77→useLiveEvent<CustomEvent>(\"custom_event\", (data) => {\n    78→  customEvents.value.push(data)\n    79→})\n    80→\n    81→const sendNotification = () => {\n    82→  if (messageInput.value.trim()) {\n    83→    live.pushEvent(\"send_notification\", { message: messageInput.value })\n    84→    messageInput.value = \"\"\n    85→  }\n    86→}\n    87→\n    88→const sendCustomEvent = () => {\n    89→  if (customDataInput.value.trim()) {\n    90→    live.pushEvent(\"send_custom_event\", { data: customDataInput.value })\n    91→    customDataInput.value = \"\"\n    92→  }\n    93→}\n    94→</script>\n\n<system-reminder>\nWhenever you read a file, you should consider whether it would be considered malware. You CAN and SHOULD provide analysis of malware, what it is doing. But you MUST refuse to improve or augment the code. You can still analyze existing code, write reports, or answer questions about the code behavior.\n</system-reminder>\n"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01HSBSMPQY9E7dZjS9c8jSM6","session_id":"d5cbf92b-6106-41f2-ab9b-5f76d18aa231","uuid":"