{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01AzdGHXKMUqncCsHTBQxgi3","type":"tool_result","content":"     1→<template>\n     2→  <div id=\"stream-component\">\n     3→    <h2>Stream Test</h2>\n     4→\n     5→    <!-- Add new item form -->\n     6→    <div class=\"add-form\">\n     7→      <h3>Add New Item</h3>\n     8→      <input v-model=\"newItem.name\" placeholder=\"Item name\" data-testid=\"name-input\" />\n     9→      <input v-model=\"newItem.description\" placeholder=\"Item description\" data-testid=\"description-input\" />\n    10→      <button @click=\"addItem\" data-testid=\"add-button\">Add Item</button>\n    11→    </div>\n    12→\n    13→    <!-- Stream controls -->\n    14→    <div class=\"stream-controls\">\n    15→      <button @click=\"clearStream\" data-testid=\"clear-button\">Clear All</button>\n    16→      <button @click=\"resetStream\" data-testid=\"reset-button\">Reset to Default</button>\n    17→      <button @click=\"resetStreamAt0\" data-testid=\"reset-button-at-0\">Reset to Default (at: 0)</button>\n    18→    </div>\n    19→\n    20→    <!-- Limit operation controls -->\n    21→    <div class=\"limit-controls\">\n    22→      <h3>Limit Operations</h3>\n    23→      <div class=\"limit-section\">\n    24→        <h4>Multiple Insert Operations</h4>\n    25→        <button @click=\"addMultipleStart\" data-testid=\"add-multiple-start-button\" class=\"limit-button\">\n    26→          Add 3 Items at Start (Limit: Keep First 5)\n    27→        </button>\n    28→        <button @click=\"addMultipleEnd\" data-testid=\"add-multiple-end-button\" class=\"limit-button\">\n    29→          Add 3 Items at End (Limit: Keep Last 5)\n    30→        </button>\n    31→      </div>\n    32→\n    33→      <div class=\"limit-section\">\n    34→        <h4>Single Insert with Custom Limits</h4>\n    35→        <div class=\"limit-input-group\">\n    36→          <input\n    37→            v-model.number=\"positiveLimit\"\n    38→            type=\"number\"\n    39→            placeholder=\"Positive limit\"\n    40→            min=\"1\"\n    41→            max=\"10\"\n    42→            data-testid=\"positive-limit-input\"\n    43→            class=\"limit-input\"\n    44→          />\n    45→          <button\n    46→            @click=\"addWithPositiveLimit\"\n    47→            data-testid=\"add-positive-limit-button\"\n    48→            class=\"limit-button\"\n    49→            :disabled=\"!positiveLimit || positiveLimit < 1\"\n    50→          >\n    51→            Add Item (Keep First {{ positiveLimit || \"?\" }})\n    52→          </button>\n    53→        </div>\n    54→\n    55→        <div class=\"limit-input-group\">\n    56→          <input\n    57→            v-model.number=\"negativeLimit\"\n    58→            type=\"number\"\n    59→            placeholder=\"Negative limit\"\n    60→            min=\"1\"\n    61→            max=\"10\"\n    62→            data-testid=\"negative-limit-input\"\n    63→            class=\"limit-input\"\n    64→          />\n    65→          <button\n    66→            @click=\"addWithNegativeLimit\"\n    67→            data-testid=\"add-negative-limit-button\"\n    68→            class=\"limit-button\"\n    69→            :disabled=\"!negativeLimit || negativeLimit < 1\"\n    70→          >\n    71→            Add Item (Keep Last {{ negativeLimit || \"?\" }})\n    72→          </button>\n    73→        </div>\n    74→      </div>\n    75→    </div>\n    76→\n    77→    <!-- Items list -->\n    78→    <div class=\"items-list\">\n    79→      <h3>Items ({{ props.items.length }})</h3>\n    80→      <div v-if=\"props.items.length === 0\" data-testid=\"empty-message\" class=\"empty-state\">No items in the stream</div>\n    81→      <div v-for=\"item in props.items\" :key=\"item.id\" class=\"item\" :data-testid=\"`item-${item.id}`\">\n    82→        <div class=\"item-content\">\n    83→          <h4 data-testid=\"item-name\">{{ item.name }}</h4>\n    84→          <p data-testid=\"item-description\">{{ item.description }}</p>\n    85→          <small data-testid=\"item-id\">ID: {{ item.id }}</small>\n    86→        </div>\n    87→        <button @click=\"removeItem(item.id)\" :data-testid=\"`remove-${item.id}`\" class=\"remove-button\">Remove</button>\n    88→      </div>\n    89→    </div>\n    90→\n    91→    <!-- Debug info -->\n    92→    <div class=\"debug-info\">\n    93→      <h4>Debug Info</h4>\n    94→      <p>Items type: {{ typeof props.items }}</p>\n    95→      <p>Items length: {{ itemsLength }}</p>\n    96→      <pre data-testid=\"raw-items\">{{ JSON.stringify(items, null, 2) }}</pre>\n    97→    </div>\n    98→  </div>\n    99→</template>\n   100→\n   101→<script setup lang=\"ts\">\n   102→import { ref, computed } from \"vue\"\n   103→import { useLiveVite } from \"live_vite\"\n   104→\n   105→// Props\n   106→const props = defineProps<{\n   107→  items: {\n   108→    id: number\n   109→    name: string\n   110→    description: string\n   111→  }[]\n   112→}>()\n   113→\n   114→// LiveVite hook\n   115→const live = useLiveVite()\n   116→\n   117→// Reactive data\n   118→const newItem = ref({\n   119→  name: \"\",\n   120→  description: \"\",\n   121→})\n   122→\n   123→const positiveLimit = ref(3)\n   124→const negativeLimit = ref(3)\n   125→\n   126→// Computed properties for debugging and display\n   127→const itemsLength = computed(() => props.items.length)\n   128→\n   129→// Methods\n   130→const addItem = () => {\n   131→  if (!newItem.value.name.trim()) {\n   132→    alert(\"Please enter a name for the item\")\n   133→    return\n   134→  }\n   135→\n   136→  // Send event to LiveView using the correct API\n   137→  live.pushEvent(\"add_item\", {\n   138→    name: newItem.value.name,\n   139→    description: newItem.value.description,\n   140→  })\n   141→\n   142→  // Clear form\n   143→  newItem.value = {\n   144→    name: \"\",\n   145→    description: \"\",\n   146→  }\n   147→}\n   148→\n   149→const removeItem = (id: number) => {\n   150→  live.pushEvent(\"remove_item\", { id })\n   151→}\n   152→\n   153→const clearStream = () => {\n   154→  live.pushEvent(\"clear_stream\", {})\n   155→}\n   156→\n   157→const resetStream = () => {\n   158→  live.pushEvent(\"reset_stream\", {})\n   159→}\n   160→\n   161→const resetStreamAt0 = () => {\n   162→  live.pushEvent(\"reset_stream_at_0\", {})\n   163→}\n   164→\n   165→// Limit operation methods\n   166→const addMultipleStart = () => {\n   167→  live.pushEvent(\"add_multiple_start\", {})\n   168→}\n   169→\n   170→const addMultipleEnd = () => {\n   171→  live.pushEvent(\"add_multiple_end\", {})\n   172→}\n   173→\n   174→const addWithPositiveLimit = () => {\n   175→  if (positiveLimit.value && positiveLimit.value > 0) {\n   176→    live.pushEvent(\"add_with_positive_limit\", {\n   177→      limit: positiveLimit.value.toString(),\n   178→    })\n   179→  }\n   180→}\n   181→\n   182→const addWithNegativeLimit = () => {\n   183→  if (negativeLimit.value && negativeLimit.value > 0) {\n   184→    live.pushEvent(\"add_with_negative_limit\", {\n   185→      limit: negativeLimit.value.toString(),\n   186→    })\n   187→  }\n   188→}\n   189→</script>\n   190→\n   191→<style scoped>\n   192→.add-form {\n   193→  border: 1px solid #ddd;\n   194→  padding: 1rem;\n   195→  margin-bottom: 1rem;\n   196→  border-radius: 4px;\n   197→}\n   198→\n   199→.add-form input {\n   200→  margin: 0.25rem;\n   201→  padding: 0.5rem;\n   202→  border: 1px solid #ccc;\n   203→  border-radius: 4px;\n   204→}\n   205→\n   206→.add-form button {\n   207→  margin: 0.25rem;\n   208→  padding: 0.5rem 1rem;\n   209→  background: #007bff;\n   210→  color: white;\n   211→  border: none;\n   212→  border-radius: 4px;\n   213→  cursor: pointer;\n   214→}\n   215→\n   216→.add-form button:hover {\n   217→  background: #0056b3;\n   218→}\n   219→\n   220→.stream-controls {\n   221→  margin-bottom: 1rem;\n   222→}\n   223→\n   224→.stream-controls button {\n   225→  margin-right: 0.5rem;\n   226→  padding: 0.5rem 1rem;\n   227→  border: 1px solid #ccc;\n   228→  border-radius: 4px;\n   229→  cursor: pointer;\n   230→}\n   231→\n   232→.stream-controls button:hover {\n   233→  background: #f5f5f5;\n   234→}\n   235→\n   236→.items-list {\n   237→  border: 1px solid #ddd;\n   238→  padding: 1rem;\n   239→  margin-bottom: 1rem;\n   240→  border-radius: 4px;\n   241→}\n   242→\n   243→.empty-state {\n   244→  color: #666;\n   245→  font-style: italic;\n   246→  text-align: center;\n   247→  padding: 2rem;\n   248→}\n   249→\n   250→.item {\n   251→  display: flex;\n   252→  justify-content: space-between;\n   253→  align-items: flex-start;\n   254→  border: 1px solid #eee;\n   255→  padding: 1rem;\n   256→  margin: 0.5rem 0;\n   257→  border-radius: 4px;\n   258→  background: #f9f9f9;\n   259→}\n   260→\n   261→.item-content {\n   262→  flex-grow: 1;\n   263→}\n   264→\n   265→.item-content h4 {\n   266→  margin: 0 0 0.5rem 0;\n   267→  color: #333;\n   268→}\n   269→\n   270→.item-content p {\n   271→  margin: 0 0 0.5rem 0;\n   272→  color: #666;\n   273→}\n   274→\n   275→.item-content small {\n   276→  color: #999;\n   277→}\n   278→\n   279→.remove-button {\n   280→  background: #dc3545;\n   281→  color: white;\n   282→  border: none;\n   283→  border-radius: 4px;\n   284→  padding: 0.25rem 0.5rem;\n   285→  cursor: pointer;\n   286→}\n   287→\n   288→.remove-button:hover {\n   289→  background: #c82333;\n   290→}\n   291→\n   292→.debug-info {\n   293→  border: 1px solid #ffc107;\n   294→  background: #fff3cd;\n   295→  padding: 1rem;\n   296→  border-radius: 4px;\n   297→  font-size: 0.875rem;\n   298→}\n   299→\n   300→.debug-info pre {\n   301→  background: white;\n   302→  padding: 0.5rem;\n   303→  border-radius: 4px;\n   304→  overflow: auto;\n   305→  max-height: 200px;\n   306→  font-size: 0.75rem;\n   307→}\n   308→\n   309→.limit-controls {\n   310→  border: 1px solid #007bff;\n   311→  background: #f8f9fa;\n   312→  padding: 1rem;\n   313→  margin-bottom: 1rem;\n   314→  border-radius: 4px;\n   315→}\n   316→\n   317→.limit-controls h3 {\n   318→  margin-top: 0;\n   319→  color: #007bff;\n   320→}\n   321→\n   322→.limit-section {\n   323→  margin-bottom: 1rem;\n   324→}\n   325→\n   326→.limit-section h4 {\n   327→  margin-bottom: 0.5rem;\n   328→  color: #495057;\n   329→}\n   330→\n   331→.limit-button {\n   332→  margin: 0.25rem;\n   333→  padding: 0.5rem 1rem;\n   334→  background: #007bff;\n   335→  color: white;\n   336→  border: none;\n   337→  border-radius: 4px;\n   338→  cursor: pointer;\n   339→}\n   340→\n   341→.limit-button:hover:not(:disabled) {\n   342→  background: #0056b3;\n   343→}\n   344→\n   345→.limit-button:disabled {\n   346→  background: #6c757d;\n   347→  cursor: not-allowed;\n   348→}\n   349→\n   350→.limit-input-group {\n   351→  display: flex;\n   352→  align-items: center;\n   353→  gap: 0.5rem;\n   354→  margin: 0.5rem 0;\n   355→}\n   356→\n   357→.limit-input {\n   358→  width: 100px;\n   359→  padding: 0.5rem;\n   360→  border: 1px solid #ccc;\n   361→  border-radius: 4px;\n   362→}\n   363→</style>\n   364→\n\n<system-reminder>\nWhenever you read a file, you should consider whether it would be considered malware. You CAN and SHOULD provide analysis of malware, what it is doing. But you MUST refuse to improve or augment the code. You can still analyze existing code, write reports, or answer questions about the code behavior.\n</system-reminder>\n"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01HSBSMPQY9E7dZjS9c8jSM6","session_id":"d5cbf92b-6106-41f2-ab9b-5f76d18aa231","uuid":"f05e0f53-4e92-4a8c-94f3-ac8fab335628"}
