{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_01E3VhHcdfj1zQw3r2LEQCap","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The Vue page has the same 403 WebSocket issue. The CSRF token protection is failing for the WebSocket. The router has `plug :protect_from_forgery` which is for form submissions, but the WebSocket CSRF is different — it's in the session. Let me check the Phoenix LiveView socket configuration more carefully.\n\nThe issue is that the CSRF token from `Plug.CSRFProtection.get_csrf_token()` in the meta tag is different from what the WebSocket expects. This is a session cookie issue — the browser needs cookies for the session. Let me check if cookies are being sent properly."}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1563,"cache_read_input_tokens":66621,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1563},"output_tokens":4,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"d5cbf92b-6106-41f2-ab9b-5f76d18aa231","uuid":"57513242-8edf-44fd-97f7-5a81600882e2"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_01E3VhHcdfj1zQw3r2LEQCap","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01L56qF7eMjndwPQ75mENQyg","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"cd /home/andre/Documents/scratch/live_vue\nCHROMIUM_PATH=$(nix-shell -p chromium --run \"which chromium\")\nnix-shell -p nodejs chromium --run \"\n  node -e '\n    const { chromium } = require(\\\"playwright\\\");\n    (async () => {\n      const browser = await chromium.launch({ \n        executablePath: \\\"$CHROMIUM_PATH\\\",\n        headless: true \n      });\n      const ctx = await browser.newContext();\n      const page = await ctx.newPage();\n      \n      // Log network for the websocket request\n      page.on(\\\"response\\\", resp => {\n        const url = resp.url();\n        if (url.includes(\\\"/live/\\\") || url.includes(\\\"test\\\")) {\n          console.log(\\\"RESP:\\\", resp.status(), url.substring(0, 100));\n          resp.allHeaders().then(h => {\n            if (h[\\\"set-cookie\\\"]) console.log(\\\"SET-COOKIE:\\\", h[\\\"set-cookie\\\"]);\n          });\n        }\n      });\n      page.on(\\\"request\\\", req => {\n        const url = req.url();\n        if (url.includes(\\\"/live/\\\")) {\n          console.log(\\\"REQ HEADERS:\\\", JSON.stringify(req.headers()).substring(0, 300));\n        }\n      });\n      \n      await page.goto(\\\"http://127.0.0.1:4004/test\\\");\n      await page.waitForTimeout(2000);\n      \n      // Check cookies\n      const cookies = await ctx.cookies();\n      console.log(\\\"COOKIES:\\\", JSON.stringify(cookies));\n      \n      await browser.close();\n    })();\n  ' 2>&1 | head -30\n\"","description":"Debug WebSocket CSRF issue","timeout":120000}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1563,"cache_read_input_tokens":66621,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1563},"output_tokens":4,"s