{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_016bTix4n41FSqDZtPRW5z3a","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The session cookie is being set properly. The CSRF token from the cookie session should match. Let me check the WebSocket URL — the LiveSocket should be passing the right CSRF token. Let me look at the `connect_info` for the socket.\n\nActually, looking at the endpoint config more carefully:\n\n```elixir\nsocket \"/live\", Phoenix.LiveView.Socket, websocket: [connect_info: [session: @session_options]]\n```\n\nThe session options include the signing_salt. The CSRF token in the `params` (from the meta tag) needs to match the one in the session. Let me check if the Phoenix versions might have an issue with this, or if there's a missing plug."}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":983,"cache_read_input_tokens":68184,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":983},"output_tokens":1,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"d5cbf92b-6106-41f2-ab9b-5f76d18aa231","uuid":"bc6590cf-fade-4296-98e4-abfee64e481b"}
